# ----------------------
# 3. Autodesk Fusion 360 Specifics
# ----------------------
# Fusion creates these backup files when you edit a manifest in the UI
*.manifest.bak
# Lock files sometimes created during runtime
*.lock

# Per-machine imported/custom themes (Theme Designer Pro lite tier)
imported_themes.json

# Per-machine settings (palette geometry, etc.)
config.json

# ----------------------
# 4. Security & Local Settings
# ----------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Ignore compiled binaries/archives just in case they slip into other folders
# (installer packaging was dropped in favor of zip-file releases)
*.exe
*.msi
*.pkg
*.dmg
*.zip
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Personal reference dump (not shipped, not for review)
Archive/
